/Title (Reference articles go out of date as events develop, and updating them by hand is slow. Regenerating the article with a fine-tuned model trains every parameter and leaves no record of which tokens changed. DiffusEdit instead edits the article in place. The frozen diffusion model rewrites only the stale positions, and the system repeats the process on sentences that the rewrites themselves made wrong.)
